SCOPE NOTE — what this license does and does not cover

This MIT grant covers the ORIGINAL WORK in this repository: the analysis
tooling (core/), the pipeline scripts, and the documentation authored here.

It does NOT and CANNOT grant any rights in third-party material that this
project analyzes or references but does not contain:

  - ECU firmware images are copyrighted works of their manufacturers
    (Continental, Bosch, Volkswagen AG). They are NOT included in this
    repository (see .gitignore) and must be supplied by the user from a
    vehicle they own.

  - Decompiled/disassembled C is a DERIVED WORK of that firmware. It is never
    committed; it is regenerated locally by reproduce.sh. The MIT grant here
    does not extend to it.

  - Manufacturer calibration documentation (Funktionsrahmen / A2L / DAMOS) is
    the property of its authors. Indexes or excerpts derived from such
    documents are not redistributed here.

For research and personal-vehicle use only. Nothing here is authorization to
modify a vehicle you do not own or to operate one in a manner that violates
applicable safety or emissions regulations.
